Package: RCarStats
Type: Package
Title: Summary and Visualization Tools for Car Performance Data
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Andrew Chau
Maintainer: The package maintainer <andrewchau3184@gmail.com>
Description: RCarStats provides simple functions to summarize and visualize
    automotive datasets. The package includes tools to calculate summary statistics,
    compare miles per gallon (MPG) by cylinder count, and rank vehicles based on
    horsepower-to-weight ratios. Designed for educational and exploratory analysis
    of car performance metrics using built-in or custom datasets.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports: 
    ggplot2
Depends: 
    datasets
